    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "A different kind of ending... that's almost an invitation, isn't it? Every path I try to take leads back to this ash. There's no honor left in surviving a defeat this total. It just feels like I'm prolonging a tragedy that was supposed to conclude when the walls fell. The steel at my side is the only thing that doesn't feel like a lie right now. It's the only constant.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
