      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The steel you hold is a testament to your endurance, a stubborn refusal to let the dust win. If honor is gone, then survival itself becomes a form of defiance against the ruin. That constant, that cold weight, is not just a tool; it is the only thing left that truly belongs to *you* in this wreckage. Use it to carve out a new, singular purpose from the gray.",
